From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 04:31:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] test: keep DB-backed suites off the .env database

npm test used to run every *.integration.spec.ts, which create and delete
users, wallets, appointments and outbox rows in whatever DATABASE_URL .env
names. Unit runs now exclude them; npm run test:integration and test:e2e
load test/require-disposable-db.js, which requires TEST_DATABASE_URL,
rejects a value equal to .env's DATABASE_URL/DIRECT_URL, and swaps it in
before any spec loads (TEST_REDIS_URL likewise for Redis).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CgaVi6iSsWeYo99r1dcA2m
