Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test: align stale specs with current outbox, notification
 and booking rules

- outbox worker: assert fenced updateMany outcomes, SKIPPED with the claim
  attempt refunded, event-id propagation, bounded attempts, stale-worker
  no-op and claim accounting (runtime unchanged)
- notification dispatch: production templates are PUSH-only; per-channel
  rules are exercised with fixture templates, plus disabled-PUSH cases
- Arabic catalog: EMAIL_NOT_EDITABLE, VISIT_STATUS_MANAGED_BY_SYSTEM
- notification reliability: drain until the test's own event is claimed
  instead of depending on an empty outbox
- pharmacy races 3-5: the loser may fail on the stale version or on the
  state machine depending on timing; both are accepted, row checks kept
- doctor-dashboard e2e: one-step patient reschedule (894cba6) and the
  write-once profile email (00878e1), including their negative sides

